msgstr "Toon systeemstatus weergave zoals geluid, batterij en Bluetooth."

#: src/panel/applets/tasklist/TasklistApplet.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Task List"
msgstr "Takenlijst"

#: src/panel/applets/tasklist/TasklistApplet.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid "An application task list with icons and labels."
msgstr "Een takenlijst van de applicatie met pictogrammen en labels."

#: src/panel/applets/trash/TrashApplet.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid "Manage your trash from the Ragnar panel"
msgstr "Beheer prullenbak vanaf het Ragnar-paneel"

#: src/panel/applets/tray/TrayApplet.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "System Tray"
msgstr "Systeemvak"

#: src/panel/applets/tray/TrayApplet.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid ""
"System tray implementing the Freedesktop Status Notifier specification."
msgstr ""
"Systeemvak dat de Freedesktop Status Notifier-specificatie implementeert."

#: src/panel/applets/user-indicator/UserIndicator.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "User Indicator"
msgstr "Gebruikersindicator"

#: src/panel/applets/user-indicator/UserIndicator.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid "Opens the power dialog."
msgstr "Opent het afsluit/slaapstand/sluimerstand scherm."

#: src/panel/applets/workspaces/WorkspacesApplet.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Workspace Switcher"
msgstr "Werkblad Wisselaar"

#: src/panel/applets/workspaces/WorkspacesApplet.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid "Display workspaces and switch between them."
msgstr "Weergeef en kies tussen bureaubladen."

#: src/panel/ragnar-desktop-settings.desktop.in:3
msgid "Change desktop appearance and behavior"
msgstr "Wijzig uiterlijk en gedrag van het bureaublad"

#: src/panel/ragnar-desktop-settings.desktop.in:12
msgid "Preferences;Settings;"
msgstr ""

#: src/panel/ragnar-panel.desktop.in:3
msgid "Ragnar Panel"
msgstr "Ragnar Paneel"

#: src/panel/ragnar-panel.desktop.in:4
msgid ""
"Launch other applications and provide various utilities to manage windows, "
"show the time, etc."
msgstr ""
"Andere toepassingen opstarten die diverse tools verstrekken om vensters in "
"te stellen ,de tijd tonen, etc."

#: src/raven/widgets/calendar/Calendar.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Calendar"
msgstr "Kalender"

#: src/raven/widgets/calendar/Calendar.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid ""
"A simple calendar with a month view, using the built-in Gtk.Calendar widget."
" The calendar shows the current date by default."
msgstr ""
"Een simpele kalender met maandoverzicht, gebruikmakend van de Gtk.Calender "
"widget. De kalender weergeeft met standaardinstelling de huidige datum aan."

#: src/raven/widgets/media-controls/MediaControls.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Media Controls"
msgstr "Media Controls"

#: src/raven/widgets/media-controls/MediaControls.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid ""
"This widget uses the Mpris API to show actively playing media with metadata "
"and playback controls, with support for audio and video."
msgstr ""
"Deze widget maakt gebruik van de Mpris API om actief afgespeelde media weer "
"te geven met metagegevens en afspeelknoppen, met ondersteuning voor audio en"
" video."

#: src/raven/widgets/sound-input/SoundInput.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Sound Input"
msgstr "Geluidsinvoer"

#: src/raven/widgets/sound-input/SoundInput.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid ""
"Allows adjustment of audio input volume, and displays a list of available "
"audio input devices."
msgstr ""
"Hiermee kunt u het audio-invoervolume aanpassen en een lijst met beschikbare"
" audio-invoerapparaten weergeven."

#: src/raven/widgets/sound-output/SoundOutput.plugin.desktop.in:4
msgid "Sound Output"
msgstr "Geluidsuitvoer"

#: src/raven/widgets/sound-output/SoundOutput.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid ""
"Allows global and per-app audio output volume control, and displays a list "
"of available audio output devices."
msgstr ""
"Hiermee kunt u het volume van de audio-uitvoer globaal en per app regelen. "
"Er wordt ook een lijst met beschikbare audio-uitvoerapparaten weergegeven."

#: src/raven/widgets/usage-monitor/UsageMonitor.plugin.desktop.in:5
msgid ""
"A view for system resource usage in bar graph form. Includes CPU, RAM, and "
"Swap usage by default."
msgstr ""
"Een weergave voor systeembrongebruik in staafdiagramvorm. Inclusief CPU-, "
"RAM- en swapgebruik standaard."

